{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_title", "source_sha256": "652c15dd213a614f0d28a79192e31295ec2dcccca44e4d821de6d2fb6af65c1e", "ja": "ほうき星は知っていた", "zh": "扫帚星早已知晓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3229e2bba2989c7a9fa42c703cc4edc592aadbdf2663b82045c99f3cf96e1f52", "ja": "ロック界隈で知名度がアップし何かと好調な\nジュリア。だが定期公演前、新レーベルへの\n移籍話を聞いてしまいショックを受ける。\n仲間達に背中を押されたジュリアは、意を\n決してプロデューサーに真意を問う。", "zh": "在摇滚界知名度上升、各方面都顺风顺水的\n茱莉亚。但在定期公演前，却因听到了转投\n新唱片公司的传闻而大受打击。\n在同伴们的鼓励下，茱莉亚下定决心，\n前去向制作人询问真正的用意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1000_p", "source_sha256": "76cf625f147afa5140189ba48e442eeefea5759b88774433e3e7e73dbbf4f17d", "ja": "（ジュリアの新曲ステージが終わった。\n……うん、いい曲だったな）", "zh": "（茱莉亚的新歌舞台结束了。……嗯，是首好歌啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "1069d05157d6b9ccb8fd1e581ded294d51723dccc1744dfd19c46ea0c3481e77", "ja": "新曲で、『アロー彗星』でした。\n聴いてくれて、ありがとう。", "zh": "新歌是《阿罗彗星》。\n谢谢你来听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "d46b1298cf875eb3be9c4cdbac51a0359a7796efdc4f48769333d352f9b12422", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "b74f9a6f9a4dcbb2ce5526418b1ab85dfa192cdca55f479945660b837b56480b", "ja": "えっと……今回、ちょっと心境の変化っていうか。\n普段のあたしがやらないことをやってみようと思って。", "zh": "那个……这次算是心境发生了点变化吧。\n我想试试看做些平时的我不会做的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "d3401218d81efb0adc03ec79e48fc03673817a56bd26bc1664051c74af2d8d41", "ja": "それで、ラブソングを作ってみたんだけど。\nやっぱガラじゃなかったかな。", "zh": "所以，我试着写了一首情歌。\n果然还是不太适合我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "8aff42ed8d2aaaeeb5c94f24f17e8b7e7dadcb6d103d75d2285d3d31499e947a", "ja": "そんなことないよー！！！", "zh": "才不是那样呢——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "363cc19a16c598977938e1eb37aff3020bfb71c9ac1000deafd9ce25c942574d", "ja": "はは、サンキュ！\n……みんななら、そう言ってくれると思ってた。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢！\n……我就知道是大家的话，一定会这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "81ff78ed6cbe8808abae8f5c970cd65e68209fc34be7d8fb10646557b8cef835", "ja": "いる場所が変わっても、取り巻く人が変わっても、\nあたしはあたしだ。……これからもよろしくな！", "zh": "就算身处的地方变了，身边的人变了，\n我也还是我。……今后也请多指教啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1008_audience", "source_sha256": "38993fdfbd5a8352e0afe54c4b009f68ce0384284005ea73e6f344e6ab0b3a79", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア……", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1009_p", "source_sha256": "322ca30850fc632aa70d559cadad8169a72928eb637d428c022e96d1008c57ef", "ja": "お疲れ、ジュリア。\n新曲初披露、大成功だな！", "zh": "辛苦了，茱莉亚。\n新歌首次亮相，大获成功啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "ad8f1e01d5d85be04f7ff7c59ac2ac6b76648477dc8eba2b11a5f4fbc2f8a45f", "ja": "サンキュ。\n……まあ、色々あったけどな……。", "zh": "谢啦。\n……不过，确实发生了不少事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a03b10bd8145657059d77693c786f13949ce19b0cbb53708bad3f205cd4e2f43", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n色々あったな……。", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n发生了很多事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1012_null", "source_sha256": "bf945507068043dc36750f4a03e38c3e163c05c894c829f910fad190ba4052e6", "ja": "あの日、あの後……", "zh": "那天，那之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9bcb022bcaaf88da685c836e096beb8cdef53885f60ca0a84dbe60e60687237d", "ja": "移籍って……何の話だ？", "zh": "转籍……你在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "5bca73465166e9fc217c3066b5be353a8140c36fbb57e554bed1d3100857b248", "ja": "この前、『Hi』のマネージャーさんと話してたろ？\n新しくレーベルを作るって。", "zh": "你之前不是和《Hi》的经纪人聊过吗？\n说是要成立一个新的唱片厂牌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1015_p", "source_sha256": "20a627a5d9d1c3f7ce431a98c910f88380649fc8ea5ddfe3e3e0332f531b794c", "ja": "ああ。先方が、新しく\nロックのレーベルを作るって話で……。", "zh": "啊。对方说要新成立一个摇滚厂牌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "e093ad49c2286f748b4ac6b791e10e97b3e63582c6b0cf72482ef031f01e7ae0", "ja": "それだよ。\n……あたしに、移籍しろっていうんだろ？", "zh": "就是这个。\n……你是想让我跳槽，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "892741df3dff10b07b6e12da02e05aea67d343966b19f7e9b2ab6dddb3604d87", "ja": "けど、御生憎様だったな！\nあたしは誰がなんと言おうと……。", "zh": "不过真不巧啊！\n不管别人怎么说，我都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1018_p", "source_sha256": "812a69de5a2d1eb78ad3c40dfbb97b06323578b130aef25fb792525090cbe541", "ja": "移籍なんて考えてないけど……。", "zh": "我没考虑过转籍什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710", "ja": "へ？", "zh": "耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1020_p", "source_sha256": "86453a08e4411e70c1257d4379b24c8a54d2624676170f11dfe0ae8d5d864547", "ja": "第一弾の目玉として、ロックとアイドルの\nコンピレーション・アルバムを作りたいって話で……。", "zh": "是想以第一弹的亮点，制作一张摇滚与偶像的\n合辑专辑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b8fe5ebb81ff0deb520ff0f7d518494be51725fcbc560ccdbd404d6746605358", "ja": "ジュリアとか千早を中心に、ロックに造詣が深いとか\n興味があるアイドル達に参加してほしいっていう……。", "zh": "希望以茱莉亚和千早为中心，邀请那些对摇滚颇有了解或感兴趣的偶像参加……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "c41d73b2abbf7a731e5763f4e29e0acfa625c7f97c930a1a8b362a6b6c3b36ea", "ja": "え…………ええ～～～！！！！", "zh": "诶…………诶诶～～～～！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "4c1477c81fc42cbd0feb899e3cc653f552e7e216376fee36dcbf4a3aa5506d97", "ja": "じゃあ……移籍は……。", "zh": "那么……转籍是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1024_p", "source_sha256": "464ad366cda3038baf97a1e72bd70ae3e00e381aa122874866c45992b610d9b3", "ja": "だからそんな話は出てないよ。それに、\n『Hi』の人達もあの時言ってたじゃないか。", "zh": "所以根本没提过那种事啊。而且，『Hi』的大家当时不也说过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1025_p", "source_sha256": "01f0aedccbf06ce8b487a1e13ab6442a26027078d3a4698d18cb6366361cb8ea", "ja": "「765プロの方がよっぽどロックだよ」って。", "zh": "“‘765事务所才要摇滚得多呢’，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_152_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "12041429c844f9dfff31448dfa2ae736f773d5c909bbc72dd6cdf4970d1b9621", "ja": "……くぅ～～～！！！！", "zh": "……唔～～～！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
